join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
Petrus: Mill parts.
- Explain what Lebo needs
	Hope: Lebo says he needs a grinding plate.
	Petrus: I know what he needs. He's been telling people since the rains.
	Petrus: There's a plate in the back, under the tarpaulin, off a mill my brother had at Nkowankowa.
	- Ask if you can take it
		Hope: Can I take it?
		Petrus: It's under about forty years of other things and I'm not shifting them at my age.
		Petrus: Clear the bench, move the drums off the tarpaulin, and we'll see what's under there. Might be nothing. My memory's not what it was.
	set {GameState.quest_petrus_mill_stash} = "active"
	[signal arg="objective:Clear access to the tarpaulin at the back of Petrus's yard"]
